'''Brineling''' is an {{Rarity|u|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water on [[Torrhus Canyon]].

== Spawning ==
'''Brineling''' can be fished up from water on [[Torrhus Canyon]]. It requires {{skl|fishing|level XV (15)}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Brineling''' is {{Green|2875}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|28.75%|1|3.48|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked.

